[{"label":"Cinematic Presentation","html":"<section\n  class=\"presentation\"\n  id=\"deck-story\"\n  data-anim-in=\"fadeIn\"\n  data-anim-in-duration=\"1800\"\n  data-anim-out=\"fadeOut\"\n  data-anim-out-duration=\"1800\"\n  style=\"\n    --presentation-ink: #050505;\n    --presentation-ink-foreground: #f6f4ef;\n    --presentation-paper: #f6f4ef;\n    --presentation-paper-foreground: #050505;\n    --presentation-accent: #ff5b35;\n    font-family: 'Avenir Next', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n  \"\n  tabindex=\"-1\"\n  aria-label=\"The streaming year - told as a sequence of claims\"\n>\n  <!-- ONE chart for the whole deck: slides name the state they show via\n       data-chart-state, and df$.shadcn.chart.deck() morphs between them -->\n  <div\n    class=\"chart presentation-stage\"\n    role=\"img\"\n    aria-label=\"Subscribers of five fictional streaming services: Nova+ 54 million, Beacon 41, Orbit 29, Lumen 18, Reel 11, compared with last year, as shares of 153 million, and monthly churn rates\"\n  ></div>\n  <section class=\"slide\" data-slide data-theme=\"ink\" aria-label=\"Cover\">\n    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position: absolute; inset-inline: 0; top: 0; height: 70px; background: #000\"></div>\n    <div\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\n      style=\"position: absolute; inset-inline: 0; bottom: 0; height: 70px; background: #000\"\n    ></div>\n    <p class=\"presentation-eyebrow\" data-df-entrance=\"fade\" style=\"position: relative\"\n      >Story state machine · Cinematic Presentation</p\n    >\n    <h1\n      class=\"presentation-title\"\n      data-df-entrance=\"up\"\n      style=\"\n        position: relative;\n        max-width: 1250px;\n        font-family: 'Avenir Next', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n        font-size: 7rem;\n      \"\n      >The streaming year</h1\n    >\n    <p\n      class=\"presentation-lede\"\n      data-df-entrance=\"up\"\n      style=\"--df-motion-delay: 200ms; position: relative; max-width: 1050px\"\n      >Five services, 153 million subscriptions, four claims - one chart that never cuts.</p\n    >\n    <p class=\"presentation-note\">Letterbox bars: this is a film.</p>\n  </section>\n  <section\n    class=\"slide\"\n    data-slide\n    data-theme=\"ink\"\n    data-chart-state=\"baseline\"\n    style=\"justify-content: flex-start\"\n    aria-label=\"Claim 1\"\n  >\n    <header class=\"presentation-header\"><span>Claim 1 · Baseline</span><span>Subscribers, millions</span></header>\n    <h2\n      class=\"presentation-title\"\n      data-df-entrance=\"up\"\n      style=\"\n        font-size: 3.4rem;\n        margin-block: 5.25rem 0.75rem;\n        max-width: 1300px;\n        font-family: 'Avenir Next', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n      \"\n      >Nova+ leads with 54 million</h2\n    >\n    <span class=\"presentation-slide-number\"></span>\n    <p class=\"presentation-note\">Establish the baseline before anything moves.</p>\n  </section>\n  <section\n    class=\"slide\"\n    data-slide\n    data-theme=\"ink\"\n    data-chart-state=\"compare\"\n    style=\"justify-content: flex-start\"\n    aria-label=\"Claim 2\"\n  >\n    <header class=\"presentation-header\"><span>Claim 2 · Comparison</span><span>This year vs last year</span></header>\n    <h2\n      class=\"presentation-title\"\n      data-df-entrance=\"up\"\n      style=\"\n        font-size: 3.4rem;\n        margin-block: 5.25rem 0.75rem;\n        max-width: 1300px;\n        font-family: 'Avenir Next', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n      \"\n      >Orbit and Reel grew fastest; Beacon shrank</h2\n    >\n    <span class=\"presentation-slide-number\"></span>\n    <p class=\"presentation-note\">The comparison bars slide in beside the baseline.</p>\n  </section>\n  <section\n    class=\"slide\"\n    data-slide\n    data-theme=\"ink\"\n    data-chart-state=\"share\"\n    style=\"justify-content: flex-start\"\n    aria-label=\"Claim 3\"\n  >\n    <header class=\"presentation-header\"><span>Claim 3 · Composition</span><span>Share of 153 million</span></header>\n    <h2\n      class=\"presentation-title\"\n      data-df-entrance=\"up\"\n      style=\"\n        font-size: 3.4rem;\n        margin-block: 5.25rem 0.75rem;\n        max-width: 1300px;\n        font-family: 'Avenir Next', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n      \"\n      >Nova+ and Beacon hold 62% of the market</h2\n    >\n    <span class=\"presentation-slide-number\"></span>\n    <p class=\"presentation-note\">The same bars fold into a donut.</p>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"slide\" data-slide data-theme=\"ink\" aria-label=\"Key figures\">\n    <p class=\"presentation-eyebrow\" data-df-entrance=\"fade\">Interlude</p>\n    <div\n      data-df-stagger\n      style=\"--df-motion-stagger-step: 220ms; display: flex; gap: 5.5rem; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 1.5rem\"\n    >\n      <div data-df-entrance=\"up\">\n        <p\n          class=\"presentation-title\"\n          style=\"\n            font-size: 6.25rem;\n            margin: 0 0 0.5rem;\n            font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n            font-family: 'Avenir Next', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n          \"\n          ><span data-count=\"153\">153</span> M</p\n        >\n        <p class=\"presentation-lede\" style=\"font-size: 1.6rem; max-width: 22rem\">subscriptions across five services</p>\n      </div>\n      <div data-df-entrance=\"up\">\n        <p\n          class=\"presentation-title\"\n          style=\"\n            font-size: 6.25rem;\n            margin: 0 0 0.5rem;\n            font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n            color: #ff5b35;\n            font-family: 'Avenir Next', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n          \"\n          >+<span data-count=\"32\">32</span>%</p\n        >\n        <p class=\"presentation-lede\" style=\"font-size: 1.6rem; max-width: 22rem\">Orbit - the fastest-growing service</p>\n      </div>\n      <div data-df-entrance=\"up\">\n        <p\n          class=\"presentation-title\"\n          style=\"\n            font-size: 6.25rem;\n            margin: 0 0 0.5rem;\n            font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n            font-family: 'Avenir Next', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n          \"\n          ><span data-count=\"3.1\">3.1</span>%</p\n        >\n        <p class=\"presentation-lede\" style=\"font-size: 1.6rem; max-width: 22rem\">monthly churn at Nova+, the lowest</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p\n      class=\"presentation-lede\"\n      data-df-entrance=\"fade\"\n      style=\"--df-motion-delay: 800ms; font-size: 1.8rem; margin-top: 3.25rem; max-width: 1200px\"\n      >Growth wins headlines. Churn wins years.</p\n    >\n    <p class=\"presentation-note\">The line of the interlude.</p>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"slide\" data-slide data-theme=\"ink\" aria-label=\"Screen\" style=\"overflow: hidden\">\n    <video\n      autoplay\n      muted\n      loop\n      playsinline\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\n      style=\"\n        position: absolute;\n        inset: 0;\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 100%;\n        object-fit: cover;\n        opacity: 0.55;\n        mix-blend-mode: screen;\n      \"\n    >\n      <source src=\"videos/demo.webm\" type=\"video/webm\" />\n      <source src=\"videos/demo.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" />\n    </video>\n    <div\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\n      style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #050505 40%, rgba(255, 91, 53, 0.2))\"\n    ></div>\n    <p class=\"presentation-eyebrow\" data-df-entrance=\"fade\" style=\"position: relative\">Act II</p>\n    <h2\n      class=\"presentation-title\"\n      data-df-entrance=\"blur\"\n      style=\"\n        position: relative;\n        font-size: 5rem;\n        max-width: 1100px;\n        font-family: 'Avenir Next', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n        font-size: 5.5rem;\n      \"\n      >Everyone subscribes. Few stay.</h2\n    >\n    <p\n      class=\"presentation-lede\"\n      data-df-entrance=\"up\"\n      style=\"--df-motion-delay: 400ms; position: relative; max-width: 900px\"\n      >The average subscriber tried 3.4 services this year and kept 2.1.</p\n    >\n    <p class=\"presentation-note\">Hold on the dark frame.</p>\n  </section>\n  <section\n    class=\"slide\"\n    data-slide\n    data-theme=\"paper\"\n    data-anim-in=\"blocksIn\"\n    data-anim-in-direction=\"north\"\n    data-anim-in-blocks=\"4\"\n    data-anim-in-color=\"#FF5B35\"\n    aria-label=\"Service table\"\n  >\n    <header class=\"presentation-header\"><span>The ledger</span><span>Millions of subscribers</span></header>\n    <div class=\"table-container\" data-df-entrance=\"up\" style=\"margin-top: 3rem\">\n      <table class=\"table\" data-density=\"spacious\" style=\"font-size: 1.7rem\">\n        <caption class=\"table-caption\" style=\"font-size: 1.35rem\"\n          >Five fictional streaming services (synthetic).</caption\n        >\n        <thead>\n          <tr class=\"table-row\"\n            ><th class=\"table-head\">Service</th><th class=\"table-head\" style=\"text-align: right\">Last year</th\n            ><th class=\"table-head\" style=\"text-align: right\">This year</th\n            ><th class=\"table-head\" style=\"text-align: right\">Change</th\n            ><th class=\"table-head\" style=\"text-align: right\">Monthly churn</th></tr\n          >\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"table-row\"\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\">Nova+</td><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right\">46</td\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right\">54</td\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right\">+17%</td\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right\">3.1%</td></tr\n          >\n          <tr class=\"table-row\"\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\">Beacon</td><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right\">43</td\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right\">41</td\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right\">−5%</td\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right\">4.4%</td></tr\n          >\n          <tr class=\"table-row\"\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\">Orbit</td><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right\">22</td\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right\">29</td\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right\">+32%</td\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right\">5.8%</td></tr\n          >\n          <tr class=\"table-row\"\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\">Lumen</td><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right\">19</td\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right\">18</td\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right\">−5%</td\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right\">6.2%</td></tr\n          >\n          <tr class=\"table-row\"\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\">Reel</td><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right\">7</td\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right\">11</td\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right\">+57%</td\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right\">7.9%</td></tr\n          >\n        </tbody>\n        <tfoot>\n          <tr class=\"table-row\"\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\">Total</td><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right; font-weight: 700\">137</td\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right; font-weight: 700\">153</td\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right; font-weight: 700\">+12%</td\n            ><td class=\"table-cell\" style=\"text-align: right; font-weight: 700\">—</td></tr\n          >\n        </tfoot>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"presentation-slide-number\"></span>\n    <p class=\"presentation-note\">Reel grew 57% - from the smallest base.</p>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"slide\" data-slide data-theme=\"paper\" aria-label=\"Field note\">\n    <blockquote data-df-entrance=\"iris\" style=\"margin: 0; max-width: 1250px\">\n      <p\n        class=\"presentation-title\"\n        style=\"\n          font-size: 3.3rem;\n          line-height: 1.22;\n          font-family: 'Avenir Next', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n          font-weight: 700;\n          letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n          font-size: 3.2rem;\n        \"\n        >“We did not win on catalogue. We won on the people who stopped cancelling.”</p\n      >\n    </blockquote>\n    <div\n      data-df-entrance=\"fade\"\n      style=\"--df-motion-delay: 600ms; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.75rem; margin-top: 2.75rem\"\n    >\n      <span\n        class=\"avatar\"\n        data-size=\"xl\"\n        style=\"width: 6.5rem; height: 6.5rem; font-size: 2.25rem; background: #ff5b35; color: #050505\"\n        ><span class=\"avatar-fallback\">IN</span></span\n      >\n      <p class=\"presentation-lede\" style=\"font-size: 1.7rem\"\n        >Ines Navarro<br /><span style=\"opacity: 0.7; font-size: 1.4rem\">Head of retention, Nova+ - fictional</span></p\n      >\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"presentation-note\">Sets up the churn claim.</p>\n  </section>\n  <section\n    class=\"slide\"\n    data-slide\n    data-theme=\"ink\"\n    data-chart-state=\"churn\"\n    style=\"justify-content: flex-start\"\n    aria-label=\"Claim 4\"\n  >\n    <header class=\"presentation-header\"><span>Claim 4 · Churn</span><span>Monthly churn, %</span></header>\n    <h2\n      class=\"presentation-title\"\n      data-df-entrance=\"up\"\n      style=\"\n        font-size: 3.4rem;\n        margin-block: 5.25rem 0.75rem;\n        max-width: 1300px;\n        font-family: 'Avenir Next', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n      \"\n      >The smaller the service, the faster it leaks</h2\n    >\n    <span class=\"presentation-slide-number\"></span>\n    <p class=\"presentation-note\">The donut unfolds into churn bars - the fourth claim.</p>\n  </section>\n  <section\n    class=\"slide\"\n    data-slide\n    data-theme=\"paper\"\n    style=\"justify-content: flex-start\"\n    aria-label=\"Questions from the audience\"\n  >\n    <header class=\"presentation-header\"><span>Q & A</span><span>After the screening</span></header>\n    <h2\n      class=\"presentation-title\"\n      data-df-entrance=\"up\"\n      style=\"\n        font-size: 3.2rem;\n        margin-block: 5.25rem 1.5rem;\n        font-family: 'Avenir Next', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n      \"\n      >Questions from the audience</h2\n    >\n    <div class=\"accordion\" data-df-stagger style=\"--df-motion-stagger-step: 160ms; max-width: 1300px\">\n      <details class=\"accordion-item\" name=\"st-qa\" open data-df-entrance=\"up\">\n        <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\" style=\"font-size: 1.9rem; padding-block: 1.4rem\"\n          ><span>Can Reel keep growing at 57%?</span\n          ><svg\n            class=\"accordion-chevron\"\n            aria-hidden=\"true\"\n            width=\"28\"\n            height=\"28\"\n            viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n            fill=\"none\"\n            stroke=\"currentColor\"\n            stroke-width=\"2\"\n          >\n            <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\" /></svg\n        ></summary>\n        <div class=\"accordion-content\" style=\"font-size: 1.6rem; line-height: 1.5\"\n          ><p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.4rem\"\n            >Not at 7.9% monthly churn: it replaces almost its whole base every year.</p\n          ></div\n        >\n      </details>\n      <details class=\"accordion-item\" name=\"st-qa\" data-df-entrance=\"up\">\n        <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\" style=\"font-size: 1.9rem; padding-block: 1.4rem\"\n          ><span>Why did Beacon shrink?</span\n          ><svg\n            class=\"accordion-chevron\"\n            aria-hidden=\"true\"\n            width=\"28\"\n            height=\"28\"\n            viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n            fill=\"none\"\n            stroke=\"currentColor\"\n            stroke-width=\"2\"\n          >\n            <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\" /></svg\n        ></summary>\n        <div class=\"accordion-content\" style=\"font-size: 1.6rem; line-height: 1.5\"\n          ><p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.4rem\"\n            >A price rise in spring; churn jumped from 3.6% to 4.4% the month after.</p\n          ></div\n        >\n      </details>\n      <details class=\"accordion-item\" name=\"st-qa\" data-df-entrance=\"up\">\n        <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\" style=\"font-size: 1.9rem; padding-block: 1.4rem\"\n          ><span>What wins next year?</span\n          ><svg\n            class=\"accordion-chevron\"\n            aria-hidden=\"true\"\n            width=\"28\"\n            height=\"28\"\n            viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n            fill=\"none\"\n            stroke=\"currentColor\"\n            stroke-width=\"2\"\n          >\n            <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\" /></svg\n        ></summary>\n        <div class=\"accordion-content\" style=\"font-size: 1.6rem; line-height: 1.5\"\n          ><p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.4rem\"\n            >Bundles - services sold together churned 40% less in the pilot markets.</p\n          ></div\n        >\n      </details>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"presentation-slide-number\"></span>\n    <p class=\"presentation-note\">The Reel answer is the sharpest.</p>\n  </section>\n  <section\n    class=\"slide\"\n    data-slide\n    data-dg-slide\n    data-theme=\"ink\"\n    style=\"justify-content: flex-start\"\n    aria-label=\"The data behind the claims\"\n  >\n    <header class=\"presentation-header\"><span>Data model</span><span>The data behind the claims</span></header>\n    <h2\n      class=\"presentation-title\"\n      data-df-entrance=\"up\"\n      style=\"\n        font-size: 3.4rem;\n        margin-block: 4.5rem 1.75rem;\n        max-width: 1300px;\n        font-family: 'Avenir Next', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n      \"\n      >Every claim, one query away</h2\n    >\n    <div style=\"width: 1020px; transform: scale(1.3); transform-origin: 0 0\">\n      <figure\n        class=\"diagram\"\n        id=\"stream-er\"\n        data-type=\"er\"\n        data-steps\n        data-interactive\n        data-autoplay=\"900\"\n        aria-label=\"Streaming data model: services, plans, subscriptions, subscribers, titles and viewing\"\n      >\n        <div class=\"diagram-canvas\" style=\"--cols: 3; --diagram-gap-y: 2.75rem; --diagram-gap-x: 4.5rem\">\n          <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"service\" data-step=\"1\" style=\"--col: 1; --row: 1\">\n            <span class=\"diagram-node-eyebrow\">Entity</span>\n            <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Service</span>\n            <ul class=\"diagram-node-fields\">\n              <li># id</li>\n              <li>name</li>\n              <li>launched</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"plan\" data-step=\"2\" style=\"--col: 2; --row: 1\">\n            <span class=\"diagram-node-eyebrow\">Entity</span>\n            <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Plan</span>\n            <ul class=\"diagram-node-fields\">\n              <li># id</li>\n              <li>→ service</li>\n              <li>price</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div\n            class=\"diagram-node\"\n            data-node=\"subscription\"\n            data-tone=\"accent\"\n            data-step=\"3\"\n            style=\"--col: 3; --row: 1\"\n          >\n            <span class=\"diagram-node-eyebrow\">Entity</span>\n            <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Subscription</span>\n            <ul class=\"diagram-node-fields\">\n              <li>→ subscriber</li>\n              <li>→ plan</li>\n              <li>started · churned</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"title\" data-step=\"4\" style=\"--col: 1; --row: 2\">\n            <span class=\"diagram-node-eyebrow\">Entity</span>\n            <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Title</span>\n            <ul class=\"diagram-node-fields\">\n              <li># id</li>\n              <li>→ service</li>\n              <li>genre</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"viewing\" data-step=\"5\" style=\"--col: 2; --row: 2\">\n            <span class=\"diagram-node-eyebrow\">Event</span>\n            <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Viewing</span>\n            <ul class=\"diagram-node-fields\">\n              <li>→ subscriber</li>\n              <li>→ title</li>\n              <li>minutes</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"subscriber\" data-step=\"3\" style=\"--col: 3; --row: 2\">\n            <span class=\"diagram-node-eyebrow\">Entity</span>\n            <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Subscriber</span>\n            <ul class=\"diagram-node-fields\">\n              <li># id</li>\n              <li>country</li>\n              <li>signed up</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <ol class=\"diagram-edges\">\n          <li\n            class=\"diagram-edge\"\n            data-from=\"service\"\n            data-to=\"plan\"\n            data-head=\"one-many\"\n            data-tail=\"one\"\n            data-from-label=\"1\"\n            data-to-label=\"1..*\"\n            data-step=\"2\"\n            >offers</li\n          >\n          <li\n            class=\"diagram-edge\"\n            data-from=\"plan\"\n            data-to=\"subscription\"\n            data-head=\"zero-many\"\n            data-tail=\"one\"\n            data-from-label=\"1\"\n            data-to-label=\"0..*\"\n            data-step=\"3\"\n            >sold as</li\n          >\n          <li\n            class=\"diagram-edge\"\n            data-from=\"subscriber\"\n            data-to=\"subscription\"\n            data-head=\"one-many\"\n            data-tail=\"one\"\n            data-step=\"3\"\n            >holds</li\n          >\n          <li\n            class=\"diagram-edge\"\n            data-from=\"service\"\n            data-to=\"title\"\n            data-head=\"one-many\"\n            data-tail=\"one\"\n            data-step=\"4\"\n            >streams</li\n          >\n          <li\n            class=\"diagram-edge\"\n            data-from=\"title\"\n            data-to=\"viewing\"\n            data-head=\"zero-many\"\n            data-tail=\"one\"\n            data-step=\"5\"\n            >watched in</li\n          >\n          <li\n            class=\"diagram-edge\"\n            data-from=\"subscriber\"\n            data-to=\"viewing\"\n            data-head=\"zero-many\"\n            data-tail=\"one\"\n            data-step=\"5\"\n            >watches</li\n          >\n        </ol>\n      </figure>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"presentation-slide-number\"></span>\n    <p class=\"presentation-note\"\n      >The entities the five claims are computed from - click an entity to see what it relates to.</p\n    >\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"slide\" data-slide data-theme=\"ink\" aria-label=\"Takeaways\">\n    <header class=\"presentation-header\"><s